<td>🔴 High</td>
<td>Ensure at least two alert levels</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Review top-up arrival times</td>
<td>🔴 High</td>
<td>Identify slowest top-up channels and avoid them</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Evaluate exchange rate hedging</td>
<td>🟡 Medium</td>
<td>Worth considering for teams spending $50k+ monthly</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Audit fund concentration</td>
<td>🟡 Medium</td>
<td>No single platform should exceed 50%</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Optimize payment cycle matching</td>
<td>🟢 Low</td>
<td>Priority for teams with credit lines</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Fund management isn't "saved"—it's "managed." Incorporating these five metrics into your weekly observation checklist helps you avoid pitfalls and seize opportunity windows as your投放 scale grows.</p>
